wh40k-class-specialization-warrior-blade-path-name = Path of the Crimson Blade
wh40k-class-specialization-warrior-blade-path-description = Melee damage, dueling, momentum, and path-checked charges.

wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-01-name = Blade Discipline
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-01-description = Unlocks the branch's combat stance; bonuses work only with suitable melee weapons.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-02-name = Measured Cut
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-02-description = The first accurate hit builds a little momentum, which is lost on a miss or target change.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-03-name = Duelist's Footwork
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-03-description = Improves melee positioning without replacing the universal Phantom Step ability.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-04-name = Counterstrike
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-04-description = Timely defense enables a quick retaliatory strike against the current opponent.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-05-name = Find the Gap
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-05-description = Briefly marks the target as vulnerable to the Warrior's next strike.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-06-name = Wide Arc
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-06-description = Deliberately widens a melee attack against a tightly packed group of targets.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-07-name = Bloody Momentum
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-07-description = Finishing a dangerous target restores some momentum but neither heals nor grants endless attacks.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-08-name = Cleave Armor
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-08-description = A powerful slow strike that briefly weakens defense; intended for elite NPCs, not bypassing all player armor.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-09-name = Step Through Pain
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-09-description = Once per interval, taking a hit does not interrupt preparation of the next technique.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-10-name = Relentless Hunt
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-10-description = Preserves some momentum when switching to a nearby hostile target.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-11-name = Executioner of the Weak
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-11-description = Improves a strike against an already wounded or marked target, with no bonus against healthy targets.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-12-name = Blade Rush
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-12-description = A quick short charge to a target with one strike; it stops at obstacles.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-13-name = Butcher's Rhythm
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-13-description = A series of accurate melee strikes gradually reduces attack delay up to a safe cap.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-14-name = Seize the Initiative
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-14-description = Interrupts a hostile NPC's attack preparation and gives the Warrior a window to retaliate.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-15-name = Jagged Wound
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-15-description = A critical or specially prepared strike applies a limited bleeding or weakening effect.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-16-name = Dance at Blade's Edge
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-16-description = Against a lone target, improves evasion only against that target; this is not a global defense bonus.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-17-name = Behead the Formation
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-17-description = Strikes a line before the Warrior, dealing less damage than a single-target finisher but disrupting NPC formations.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-18-name = Reckless Fury
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-18-description = A temporary aggressive stance that trades defense for greater offensive potential.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-19-name = Unrelenting Pursuit
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-19-description = A successful charge briefly increases momentum against that target.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-20-name = Crimson Breakthrough
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-blade-path-20-description = Final charge through a chain of enemies with high damage and strict path, target, and cooldown checks. It is not teleportation and cannot cross walls or safe zones.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorCounterattack = Counterattack
    .desc = Prepares a response against the selected opponent; movement or another attack breaks preparation.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorFindGap = Find the gap
    .desc = Briefly marks a visible target for the Warrior's next strike.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorSunderArmor = Sunder armor
    .desc = Prepare a slow empowered strike against the selected target.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorBladeRush = Blade rush
    .desc = Physically dash toward the selected enemy along a clear path.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorSeizeInitiative = Seize initiative
    .desc = Disrupt a hostile NPC's tempo and open a counterattack window.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorBreakFormation = Break formation
    .desc = Disrupt several nearby NPCs in a close area.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorRecklessFury = Reckless fury
    .desc = Temporarily increase melee damage at the cost of personal defense.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorRedBreakthrough = Red breakthrough
    .desc = Make a limited physical dash to a visible point along a clear path.
